{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52081","headline":"五言奉和行经破薛举战地应诏 · 杨师道","name":"五言奉和行经破薛举战地应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤纪初膺籙，龙颜昔在田。\n鸣祠凭陇嶂，召雨窃泾川。\n受律威丹浦，扬兵震阪泉。\n止戈基此地，握契硉斯年。\n六辔乘秋景，三驱被广壥。\n凝笳入晓啭，析羽杂风悬。\n塞云衔落日，关城带断烟。\n回舆登故垒，驻跸想荒阡。\n岁月方悠敻，神功逾赫然。\n微臣愿奉职，导礼翠华前。\n（同前）（按：此诗原署「太常卿驸马都尉安德郡开国公臣杨师道上」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收录本诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}